 "message": "Adding groundwork for Maya vigesimal (numerals not yet supported)\nNotes: I'll consider embedding a font with only the required glyphs\nThis includes turned 2/3 for \"dozbrit\" mode, and Chi and Open E for \"dozamer\" modes.", "created_at": "2018-06-09T17:13:55Z", "repo": "base", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "575d03a7186a4b08456589381f31868b208907a9", "message": "Added a docs folder for GitHub Pages", "created_at": "2018-06-09T12:21:17Z", "repo": "base", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5b84fe7fa95e91b6c76193805ed79b84037d1a3c", "message": "I realized big.Cmd(zero) == 0, was effectively the same as big.Sign() == 0, but without needing the extra zero instance.", "created_at": "2018-06-09T11:51:09Z", "repo": "base", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d0f9fe80c3a7989eb6e18c43c9d22f1e88859599", "message": "Changed the func signature to use the len of slice.", "created_at": "2018-01-20T08:19:42Z", "repo": "base", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "85503d21c7cda5e1a359f71eae525fbe9154f2e8", "message": "Fixxed a silly bug caused by how I was keeping track of remainders.", "created_at": "2018-01-20T05:26:21Z", "repo": "base", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "30d7356b997c7f3a84eda79176c755a8f06c18dc", "message": "Adjusting dozenal/ to fit into the library.", "created_at": "2018-01-20T03:38:31Z", "repo": "base", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "90343831f91d87a3d890237321366edebccb89fd", "message": "Add 'dozenal/' from commit '1ec1d6d9c6b47b35bea4e1bde97969413a0a7c1c'\n\ngit-subtree-dir: dozenal\ngit-subtree-mainline: 8709af8a9a8d667635e003005d5b3fb155224899\ngit-subtree-split: 1ec1d6d9c6b47b35bea4e1bde97969413a0a7c1c", "created_at": "2018-01-20T02:49:21Z", "repo": "base", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8709af8a9a8d667635e003005d5b3fb155224899", "message": "First commit. Got everything from github.com/TUSF/dozenal and made it more flexible for other bases.", "created_at": "2018-01-20T02:45:05Z", "repo": "base", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1ec1d6d9c6b47b35bea4e1bde97969413a0a7c1c", "message": "Changed the whole API and added more documentation. Also, rename package.", "created_at": "2017-12-14T22:11:48Z", "repo": "base", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "173c1069d02c38d95f6d7b3f6fe6ebc5ee839a0d", "message": "Adjustments to dec2doz, taking advantage of the fact the standard library uses decimal. Also added a TODO to make Rat() faster, maybe.", "created_at": "2017-12-14T06:46:08Z", "repo": "base", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "df5a293c4589fb51d912c55d06f6a251b7fec757", "message": "Little things, of course...", "created_at": "2017-12-14T01:40:26Z", "repo": "base", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8dc53dcfb5cd0ac13f06053b908b0f13a168e6ad", "message": "Documentation", "created_at": "2017-12-14T01:03:32Z", "repo": "base", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f293f7806144e92005c7e38168c5aacb967487ba", "message": "I forgot to add the variant using turned 2 and 3 for dec and el.", "created_at": "2017-12-14T00:53:59Z", "repo": "base", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "65577742273d27766f6c20b2bb8b47f6258533cb", "message": "Adding License.", "created_at": "2017-12-14T00:44:30Z", "repo": "base", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cb6d417b0f70d8735364f5b3dc4f4ec569c94620", "message": "first commit", "created_at": "2017-12-14T00:40:28Z", "repo": "base", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl